# Database backups produced by پشتیبان-گیری.bat
backups/

# V40 — story media persisted locally at fetch time (backend/.media/statuses).
# Real WhatsApp story images/videos: hundreds of MB, regenerable from Green API while the
# source URLs are alive. Never belongs in git.
backend/.media/

# V52 — generated test/audit artifacts. Regenerable, and a stale copy committed by a
# `git add -A` sweep is worse than no copy (a 1.1 MB project_structure.txt was committed
# this way once already). audit.md is the exception: it is committed deliberately as the
# checked-in output of deep_audit.py.
test_results*.txt
diagnostic_*.txt

# Scratch: one-off dated diagnostics, UI prototypes, and archive drops.
backend/scripts/diag_*_[0-9]*.py
ui-research/
*.zip
